Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:17.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.86,0:03:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Se o cônjuge declarado morto reaparecer de alguma forma, o casamento atual torna-se nulo de pleno direito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:21.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.94,0:03:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou seja, o casamento de vocês é considerado inválido desde o início.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:25.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.86,0:03:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouviram da boca do seu próprio advogado.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:35.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.54,0:03:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora vocês vão assinar este acordo e se divorciar imediatamente.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.94,0:04:03.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.06,0:04:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha só o ponto a que você nos fez chegar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.57,0:04:27.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.69,0:04:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dê-nos licença um momento.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:37.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.07,0:04:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Acha que não temos consciência da situação, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:46.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.62,0:04:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Acha que não sabemos do nosso estado?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:49.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.48,0:04:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,E a senhora ainda mandou chamar esse homem e o colocou ali.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:52.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.38,0:04:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ouviu toda a nossa conversa sem o menor pudor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.18,0:04:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que está fazendo isso, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:55.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.55,0:04:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós já conversamos sobre isso com a família.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:57.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós já conversamos sobre tudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:04:58.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.27,0:04:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A senhora acha que não temos noção da situação?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:00.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.77,0:05:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você já sabia, então é ainda pior, Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:05.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Se sabia, por que continuou com isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:06.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.23,0:05:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não se divorciou dessa mulher?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:09.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.69,0:05:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo sabendo que esse casamento era inválido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.59,0:05:11.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.71,0:05:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Não teve vergonha de dividir a mesma cama com ela?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:13.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.47,0:05:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, que vergonha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:15.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.84,0:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tipo de conversa é essa?! Que falta de respeito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:15.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.16,0:05:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Que vergonha o quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:18.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.88,0:05:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A verdadeira vergonha vem de vocês, não de mim!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.32,0:05:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran está vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.72,0:05:23.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.84,0:05:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lá embaixo! E sabendo que esse casamento é inválido...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:27.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.52,0:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem continua dormindo no mesmo quarto são vocês!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:28.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.56,0:05:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Imorais! Sem-vergonhas!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:32.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.88,0:05:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não fizemos nada de que devamos nos envergonhar, Dona Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.78,0:05:35.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.90,0:05:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,E a senhora é a última pessoa que pode me dar lição de moral!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está me chamando de imoral?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:39.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.42,0:05:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não estou dizendo nada, a senhora mesma decida.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.65,0:05:41.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.77,0:05:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem transformou a minha vida nisso aqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:44.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.91,0:05:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem foi o responsável por tudo isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:47.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.82,0:05:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Desde o dia em que cheguei aqui, quem foi que insistiu que eu me casasse com o Cihan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:52.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.36,0:05:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem foi que, mal nos casamos, exigiu um neto na frente de todo mundo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.44,0:05:56.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.56,0:05:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Antes de vir falar em moralidade, sente-se e pense muito bem no que a senhora fez!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:59.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.26,0:05:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,E como eu ia adivinhar que você aceitaria com tanta pressa e empolgação?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:01.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.98,0:06:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não estava empolgada com nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:02.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.18,0:06:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,E sabe quem estava?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:03.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.64,0:06:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:05.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.74,0:06:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele mandou uma gravação!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:08.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.48,0:06:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,E nela dizia ao Cihan: 'Irmão, case-se com a minha mulher!'
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.17,0:06:10.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.29,0:06:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não estava empolgada!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:15.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.00,0:06:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran mandou aquele vídeo porque achava que ia morrer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.52,0:06:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas agora ele está vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:19.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.81,0:06:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,E como eu ia saber?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:20.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.68,0:06:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sabia por acaso?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:21.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.98,0:06:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós sabíamos?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:22.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.78,0:06:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Como nós poderíamos imaginar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:23.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.98,0:06:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele falou alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.32,0:06:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Disse a um estranho: 'Se eu sobreviver, esconda isso.'
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:27.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não contou à própria esposa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:30.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.36,0:06:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não confiou nela e não contou nada à mulher dele?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:35.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.56,0:06:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vim parar aqui seguindo o cortejo de um homem que eu nem conhecia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:38.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.56,0:06:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Há um ano eu venho derramando lágrimas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:40.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabe o que eu passei aqui por causa dele?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:42.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.96,0:06:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu filho ficou traumatizado!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:44.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.99,0:06:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que ele não me disse nada?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:48.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.51,0:06:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu queria ter ido embora assim que cheguei, vocês deixaram?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:50.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.93,0:06:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês me ameaçaram usando o meu próprio filho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:52.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.65,0:06:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran não conhecia a família dele?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:55.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.12,0:06:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran não sabia que vocês fariam tudo isso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:07:00.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.47,0:07:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem vai prestar contas por tudo o que suportamos esse tempo todo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabe quem vai prestar contas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:04.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.27,0:07:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A senhora!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:07.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.03,0:07:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não tenho que prestar contas a ninguém!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:10.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.95,0:07:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não devo explicações a ninguém!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:14.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.85,0:07:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós somos os que mais sofreram com essa dor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:16.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.41,0:07:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós somos os que levaram o golpe mais duro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.51,0:07:17.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.63,0:07:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.19,0:07:19.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.31,0:07:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu e o meu filho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:21.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.51,0:07:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu e o Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:23.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.09,0:07:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não temos que prestar contas a ninguém!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.20,0:07:25.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.32,0:07:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, a verdade é esta:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:32.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.94,0:07:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A realidade é uma só:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.34,0:07:36.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.46,0:07:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran está vivo, deitado logo ali embaixo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:37.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.27,0:07:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse casamento é nulo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.77,0:07:39.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.89,0:07:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês vão se divorciar imediatamente!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.61,0:07:40.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.73,0:07:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele deixou um testamento, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:44.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.92,0:07:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele confiou a Alya e o Deniz a mim, foi o último pedido dele!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:46.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.65,0:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran vai sobreviver!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:48.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.15,0:07:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai viver!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:50.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.41,0:07:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós também queremos que ele viva, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:51.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.29,0:07:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Caia na real de uma vez!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:53.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.17,0:07:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse é o único desejo de todo mundo aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.91,0:07:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas a situação dele é delicada, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:56.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.33,0:07:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós temos que esperar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:58.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.87,0:07:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Temos que esperar, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:07:59.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.65,0:07:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu irmão tem razão.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:00.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.55,0:08:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,O que quer dizer com 'o seu irmão tem razão'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:01.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.59,0:08:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,O que quer dizer com isso, hein?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:02.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.61,0:08:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,O desejo de vocês...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.53,0:08:04.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.65,0:08:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Então é esse o desejo de vocês, não é?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:06.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.35,0:08:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês vão ficar esperando ele morrer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:08.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.89,0:08:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,É por isso que estão torcendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:10.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.23,0:08:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Falem a verdade de uma vez! Querem continuar juntos!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:12.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.91,0:08:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Estão esperando que ele morra, não é?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:16.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.51,0:08:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já não sei mais o que te dizer, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:20.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.60,0:08:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro por Deus, eu já estou cansado de você.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.07,0:08:25.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.19,0:08:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou cansado de você machucar todo mundo aqui de propósito, com frieza!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:33.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.97,0:08:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Enquanto todos vão para os seus quartos descansar, você fica rondando por aqui tramando contra os outros pelas costas! Estou farto disso!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.17,0:08:38.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.29,0:08:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, quando eu viro as costas, nunca sei a quem você vai prejudicar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:40.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.73,0:08:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo amor de Deus, pare com isso de uma vez!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.70,0:08:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, eu me cansei completamente de você!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.04,0:08:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem me dera você não fosse a minha mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:58.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.04,0:08:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha só o ponto a que você me fez chegar... Me fez dizer uma coisa dessas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:04.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.92,0:09:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora decida você mesma se merece a bênção ou a maldição de Deus!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:07.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.48,0:09:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Você enfileirou toda essa gente aqui...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:14.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.57,0:09:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Achando que ia colocar a gente no nosso lugar na frente de todos! Mãe, esquece isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.18,0:09:16.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.30,0:09:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não vai acontecer de jeito nenhum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:19.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.93,0:09:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou me divorciar, de jeito nenhum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:22.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.45,0:09:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não vamos nos divorciar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:26.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.56,0:09:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não vamos nos divorciar, Dona Sadakat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:31.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.42,0:09:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito bem! Sendo assim, eu mesma vou ao tribunal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:39.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.08,0:09:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Farei o que for preciso para anular esse casamento! Se vocês não se divorciarem, o juiz anula!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:41.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.67,0:09:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tribunal, mãe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:43.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.99,0:09:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai levar o meu irmão à justiça? O que você está fazendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:46.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.33,0:09:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi isso o que passou pela sua cabeça?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.09,0:09:48.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.21,0:09:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora me escuta muito bem!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:50.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.54,0:09:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem está deitado lá embaixo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:51.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.66,0:09:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:52.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.33,0:09:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Com os documentos de quem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:54.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.48,0:09:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,De Ömer Bakır!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:56.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.07,0:09:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você vai dizer ao juiz?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:58.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.48,0:09:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Que o Boran Albora está vivo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:10:01.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.83,0:10:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai expor o Boran, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.32,0:10:02.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.44,0:10:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,É claro que eu não vou expô-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:05.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.47,0:10:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran está aqui na mansão!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:06.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.63,0:10:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui o meu filho está seguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:08.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.97,0:10:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está protegido aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:10.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.29,0:10:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, agora me escuta com muita atenção!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.37,0:10:11.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.49,0:10:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Grave isso na sua cabeça!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:13.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.90,0:10:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai ao tribunal...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.12,0:10:14.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.24,0:10:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,E vai dizer que o Boran Albora está vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:16.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.59,0:10:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai entregar o seu próprio filho aos inimigos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.32,0:10:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,E depois, quem vai vir atrás dele?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.36,0:10:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Os inimigos do Süleyman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:23.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.09,0:10:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,O Nedim, o Demir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:26.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.22,0:10:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,E para terminar o serviço que ficou pela metade, quem é que vem, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:27.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.20,0:10:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,O Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.41,0:10:31.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.53,0:10:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, olha só... Você vive me dizendo:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.87,0:10:34.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.99,0:10:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,'Quero que o Boran viva, estou pensando no meu filho!'
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.38,0:10:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Acha mesmo que está pensando no Boran, mãe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:44.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.57,0:10:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois é, mãe! Se você aceita tudo isso, se vai ao tribunal só para nos separar e expor o Boran... que belo jeito de pensar no seu filho!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:46.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.48,0:10:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vá em frente! Pode ir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.93,0:10:48.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.05,0:10:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai logo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:51.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.42,0:10:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem mais alguma coisa para falar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:55.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.34,0:10:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não é o Ömer Bakır!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:10:59.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.63,0:10:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele é o Boran!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:02.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.08,0:11:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,É o Boran Albora, e ele está vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:03.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.16,0:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele sobreviveu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.59,0:11:08.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.71,0:11:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,E mesmo sabendo disso, vocês vão continuar casados?! É isso mesmo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:11.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.39,0:11:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, você vai se divorciar dessa mulher!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:13.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.58,0:11:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, o orgulho é um grande pecado.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:14.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.21,0:11:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Não faça isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:15.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.99,0:11:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Não cometa esse pecado.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.30,0:11:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Só para separar nós dois...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:19.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.99,0:11:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Não coloque a vida do Boran em risco!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:19.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.01,0:11:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha aqui...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:22.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.45,0:11:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,É isso o que você quer, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:25.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.70,0:11:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer mesmo que a gente assine este papel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:27.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.36,0:11:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso significa expor e entregar o Boran!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.64,0:11:30.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.76,0:11:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Na frente de todo mundo aqui você diz:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:34.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.91,0:11:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,'Eu me preocupo com o Boran mais do que todos vocês!'
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:37.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.83,0:11:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas só para nos separar, o que você vai fazer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:37.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.94,0:11:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai correr para o tribunal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:39.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.60,0:11:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,E vai expor o Boran!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.71,0:11:43.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.83,0:11:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo visto, eu amo o Boran muito mais do que você, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.63,0:11:44.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.75,0:11:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinto muito...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:46.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.41,0:11:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas eu não vou me divorciar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.13,0:11:49.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.25,0:11:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo menos não até o Boran se recuperar e se levantar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.39,0:11:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:53.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.23,0:11:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês não vão dizer nada a ele, hein?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:59.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.40,0:11:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Vão ficar calados diante dessa pouca vergonha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:02.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,O que se pode dizer a você, Dona Sadakat? O que se pode falar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:06.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.13,0:12:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha só o estado das coisas! O quê, mãe? O que quer que a gente diga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.76,0:12:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A situação já está um caos, e você fica atacando as pessoas!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:12.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, tudo só vai piorar! O que você realmente quer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:13.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.92,0:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,O que podemos te dizer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:15.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.14,0:12:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus dê o troco a vocês!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:20.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.98,0:12:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus trate vocês como merecem! Que vergonha de vocês!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:23.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.98,0:12:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que ninguém fique do meu lado, o Boran estará comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:27.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.96,0:12:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou ficar ao lado do meu filho! Eu vou mantê-lo vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:30.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.46,0:12:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,E esse casamento vai acabar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:40.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.53,0:12:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha cá, coma... coma isso no café da manhã todo dia. Isso, coma, que te faça bem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:42.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.77,0:13:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan Bey... onde o menino foi parar num piscar de olhos?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:51.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,O rapazinho não estava com os senhores?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:51.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.20,0:13:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:55.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.58,0:13:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele estava no pátio agora mesmo e de repente sumiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:13:58.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.77,0:13:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde ele foi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:13:59.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.54,0:13:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.14,0:13:59.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.26,0:13:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.98,0:14:04.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.10,0:14:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha lá, olha ele ali! Onde estão a sua mãe e o seu pai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:07.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.70,0:14:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu deixei aqui...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:08.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.35,0:14:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gostou bastante, não foi, gatinho?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:12.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.74,0:14:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come isso, come tudo e depois vem para cá, tá bom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.15,0:14:16.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.27,0:14:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, gatinho, tem mais aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:21.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.82,0:14:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não posso ficar esperando aqui, olha...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:26.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.70,0:14:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Veja só...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.81,0:14:30.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.93,0:14:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Filho...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:33.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.17,0:14:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Doutor...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:36.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.56,0:14:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:48.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.52,0:14:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:56.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.66,0:14:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:58.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.57,0:14:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.25,0:15:00.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.37,0:15:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:02.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.89,0:15:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está fazendo aqui, meu filho?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.69,0:15:04.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.81,0:15:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está fazendo aqui, meu amor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:06.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.19,0:15:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha só o gatinho, não é uma gracinha?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.68,0:15:08.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.80,0:15:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sem avisar ninguém...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:09.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.12,0:15:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ümmü, o que essa criança está fazendo aqui dentro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:11.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.66,0:15:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma, espera só um minuto...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:13.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.54,0:15:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, eu vou trazer o seu gatinho, tá?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:13.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.00,0:15:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Já vou levar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:14.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.74,0:15:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Pronto, calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:15.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.32,0:15:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.99,0:15:17.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.11,0:15:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya Hanım...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha cá.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.82,0:15:21.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.94,0:15:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya Hanım, a senhora precisa ver isto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:22.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.31,0:15:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.65,0:15:24.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.77,0:15:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi? Aconteceu alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:25.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.64,0:15:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:26.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.27,0:15:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:30.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.24,0:15:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?! Dá para falar logo?! O que está havendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:33.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.37,0:15:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fala!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.75,0:15:34.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.87,0:15:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:35.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.93,0:15:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha só, o que houve?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:36.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.18,0:15:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele se mexeu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.01,0:15:38.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.13,0:15:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:38.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.01,0:15:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.46,0:15:40.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.58,0:15:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está dizendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:41.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.15,0:15:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele se mexeu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:42.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.34,0:15:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu filho...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:42.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.84,0:15:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Os olhos dele piscaram, o rosto se moveu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.72,0:15:44.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.84,0:15:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele mexeu o dedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.91,0:15:44.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.03,0:15:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.41,0:15:45.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.53,0:15:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:46.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.03,0:15:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:48.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.03,0:15:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:49.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.82,0:15:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu querido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:51.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.76,0:15:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran, meu filho!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:53.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.46,0:15:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe-me ver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:54.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.94,0:15:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:56.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.99,0:15:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.84,0:15:59.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.96,0:15:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu filho!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:16:00.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.97,0:16:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, meu amor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:02.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.02,0:16:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Me dê isso aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:04.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.41,0:16:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe-me examinar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:05.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.29,0:16:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Veja!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:06.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.79,0:16:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe, veja só!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:08.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.46,0:16:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Me dá esse aparelho aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:14.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.13,0:16:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos descobrir os pés dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:15.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.24,0:16:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos descobrir os pés.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:17.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.24,0:16:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está dizendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.03,0:16:21.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.15,0:16:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Doutor...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:25.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.28,0:16:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está falando?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:31.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.42,0:16:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[Música de suspense]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.52,0:16:34.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.64,0:16:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,O pai dele...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.03,0:16:35.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.15,0:16:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem cá, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:36.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.85,0:16:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, venha cá, eu disse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:38.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.86,0:16:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz, meu filho, venha cá!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.21,0:16:40.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.33,0:16:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, vem cá agora mesmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.72,0:16:43.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.84,0:16:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,O dedo dele está se mexendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:46.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.19,0:16:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,O dedo está se mexendo! O dedo do meu Boran se mexeu, eu vi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.89,0:16:47.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.01,0:16:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vi com meus próprios olhos, o dedo se mexeu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:49.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.81,0:16:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,O dedo se moveu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.43,0:16:49.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.55,0:16:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, olha, olha só!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:51.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.83,0:16:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:51.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.17,0:16:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma, calma, calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.56,0:16:52.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.68,0:16:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:53.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.00,0:16:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma, irmão.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:55.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.76,0:16:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.67,0:16:58.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.79,0:16:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Deus, eu sabia! Eu disse que ele ia se recuperar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.63,0:17:00.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.75,0:17:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu filho, você vai sarar, meu querido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.97,0:17:03.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.09,0:17:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai se recuperar, minha vida!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.81,0:17:15.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.93,0:17:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Acorda, meu filho! Você estava esperando a voz do seu filho, não estava, meu tesouro? Você esperou ouvir a voz do seu menininho! Você vai se levantar, meu filho, vai se curar! Vamos, levanta, meu amor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.53,0:17:19.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.65,0:17:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Não balance ele assim! Calma, mãe, calma...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:24.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.93,0:17:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Não balance, não vai fazer bem a ele, pelo amor de Deus, não balance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:27.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.89,0:17:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, o que está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:29.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.16,0:17:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Provavelmente é apenas um reflexo involuntário.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:31.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.08,0:17:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas isso é bom ou ruim, cunhada?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.44,0:17:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vamos perder a esperança, mas precisamos esperar. Ainda não há nenhuma alteração no quadro dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.96,0:17:37.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.08,0:17:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, nós esperamos, esperamos...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:40.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.31,0:17:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não quer que ele melhore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.95,0:17:44.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.07,0:17:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim? De onde a senhora tirou isso? Juro por Deus que não é nada disso!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:46.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.47,0:17:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não quer que o meu filho se recupere!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.03,0:17:47.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.15,0:17:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Já aconteceu algo parecido antes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:49.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.35,0:17:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ser que sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.83,0:17:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ser, Dona Sadakat, e nós não tenhamos percebido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:52.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.91,0:17:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Você chamou o médico?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.21,0:17:54.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.33,0:17:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Já chamei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:56.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.81,0:17:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo, ele já foi avisado.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:58.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.49,0:17:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu filho...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:00.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.02,0:18:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi porque ele ouviu a voz do filho dele!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:02.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.52,0:18:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu filho vai se levantar! Vamos, querido!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:04.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.42,0:18:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Força, acorde, meu filho!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:07.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.46,0:18:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, o seu filho está lá fora te esperando!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:09.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.34,0:18:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estou aqui do seu lado, meu amor, vamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.27,0:18:11.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.39,0:18:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, meu Boran! Chama... chama o Deniz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.07,0:18:13.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.19,0:18:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?! Mãe, aquela criança não vai entrar aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:14.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.99,0:18:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,O pai dele... olha como ele reagiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.27,0:18:15.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.39,0:18:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não pode ver o pai nesse estado!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:17.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.91,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, não faça isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:21.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.67,0:18:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, ele é só uma criancinha, não faça isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.92,0:18:22.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.04,0:18:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz! Venha com a vovó, venha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:24.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.76,0:18:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha chamar o seu pai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:26.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.88,0:18:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem nada a ver com isso! Juro por Deus que não tem nada a ver!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:27.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.16,0:18:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Não pode ser, isso não pode acontecer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:30.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.74,0:18:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, aquele menino não vai entrar aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:34.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.06,0:18:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não pode ver o pai nessa condição!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.12,0:18:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não pode ver o pai assim!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:37.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.32,0:18:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele precisa chamar pelo pai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.74,0:18:38.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.86,0:18:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, não faça isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.62,0:18:39.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.74,0:18:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chame o meu neto!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.22,0:18:41.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Chame o meu neto aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.32,0:18:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Não! Ele não pode vê-lo assim, vocês perderam o juízo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:44.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.52,0:18:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro que não!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:45.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.42,0:18:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Larga ele!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:47.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.75,0:18:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não permito!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:48.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.49,0:18:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem é você para não permitir?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:50.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.64,0:18:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou a mãe dele!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:50.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.16,0:18:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Não venha com essa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:51.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.96,0:18:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou passar por você!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:52.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.62,0:18:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Saia da frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:53.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.00,0:18:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Me solta!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:54.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.90,0:18:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:55.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.64,0:18:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Acalmem-se!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:57.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.28,0:18:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma, por favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:03.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.30,0:19:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele mexeu o dedo! O meu netinho fez ele mexer o dedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.66,0:19:04.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.78,0:19:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega, tem gente demais aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:05.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.78,0:19:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Está cheio de gente aqui dentro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:06.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.78,0:19:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,É apenas um reflexo involuntário!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:07.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.78,0:19:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.16,0:19:08.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.28,0:19:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya, Nare!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:10.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.78,0:19:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tirem ela daqui, por favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:11.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.28,0:19:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Está cheio demais aqui dentro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.16,0:19:13.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.28,0:19:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fechem a porta!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:14.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.28,0:19:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe ele ouvir a voz do filho!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.16,0:19:15.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.28,0:19:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz! Deniz!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.14,0:19:17.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, não pode!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:27.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.34,0:19:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.82,0:19:31.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.94,0:19:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Diga ao Dr. Yalçın para falar comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:40.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.28,0:19:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Deus todo-poderoso, ouve as minhas preces!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:42.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.63,0:19:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouve as minhas orações, faz o meu filho se levantar e andar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:44.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.83,0:19:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Que ele se levante! Que o meu filho se cure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.59,0:19:46.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.71,0:19:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Que ele passe por aquela porta e me chame! Que me chame de mãe e saia andando!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.69,0:19:48.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.81,0:19:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Deus, pelo amor do Teu Mensageiro, atende a minha súplica!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:50.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.51,0:19:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu irmão... meu irmão...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.32,0:19:55.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.44,0:19:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A reação que o Boran apresentou foi apenas um reflexo involuntário.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:57.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.22,0:19:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou seja, não foi um comando consciente do cérebro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:59.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.24,0:19:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi um reflexo da medula espinhal ou um espasmo muscular.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:02.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.78,0:20:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim? Então não houve nenhuma melhora?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:04.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.49,0:20:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Infelizmente, não.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:06.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.99,0:20:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está dizendo?! Nós vimos com nossos próprios olhos!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.29,0:20:08.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.41,0:20:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,O menino chamou 'papai'!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:10.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.45,0:20:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,O filho dele o chamou, e o dedo dele se mexeu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:12.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.80,0:20:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, isso não aconteceu porque ele ouviu. O Boran não tem capacidade de ouvir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:17.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.30,0:20:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,O que quer dizer com não pode ouvir?! Foi essa mulher que te mandou dizer isso, não foi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:20.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.55,0:20:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela fez você falar isso! Vocês todos viram, não viram?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:22.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.58,0:20:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, sinto muitíssimo, mas essa é a realidade médica.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:25.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.50,0:20:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa é a realidade?! Que realidade?! Eu vou te mostrar uma coisa, Yalçın!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.46,0:20:28.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.58,0:20:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A realidade fomos nós que vimos, vimos com nossos próprios olhos! A mão dele se moveu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:32.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.72,0:20:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ouviu a voz do filho e mexeu a mão! O meu filho mexeu a mão!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:35.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.26,0:20:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou provar para vocês! Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:37.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.72,0:20:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou provar para vocês!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:38.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.54,0:20:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cadê você, Cihan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:40.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.78,0:20:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Não grite!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.47,0:20:41.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.59,0:20:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.35,0:20:42.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.47,0:20:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.91,0:20:43.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.03,0:20:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.11,0:20:44.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.23,0:20:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha cá com a vovó, venha, meu amor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.57,0:20:46.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.69,0:20:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Me ajudem aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.21,0:20:47.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.33,0:20:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Me solte! Venha cá, Deniz!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:49.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.81,0:20:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Não faça isso, é uma criança pequena!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:50.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.57,0:20:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, meu amorzinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:51.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.43,0:20:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, o que está acontecendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:53.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.85,0:20:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês também viram, a mão dele se mexeu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:54.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.53,0:20:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, vamos para o nosso quarto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:56.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.73,0:20:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está havendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.81,0:20:59.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.93,0:20:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai aprender, vai ouvir, não vai ter jeito!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:01.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.99,0:21:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A vovó vai me dizer uma coisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:03.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.81,0:21:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi, vovó?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.15,0:21:05.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.27,0:21:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vovó, o Cihan mandou...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.69,0:21:06.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.81,0:21:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai ficar calada!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:08.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.88,0:21:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,E então você vai se divorciar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.49,0:21:10.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.61,0:21:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Divorciar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.57,0:21:26.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.69,0:21:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos conversar no quarto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.49,0:21:28.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.61,0:21:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, chega! Fica quieta, para com isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:30.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.57,0:21:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que está agindo assim?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.07,0:21:30.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.19,0:21:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:32.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.12,0:21:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai se divorciar dessa mulher!
