Dialogue: 1,1:53:01.71,1:53:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Você ouviu da própria boca dele!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.28,1:53:04.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:03.40,1:53:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está dizendo que não fez isso!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.10,1:53:05.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:04.22,1:53:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegue as suas calúnias e dê o fora daqui!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.36,1:53:06.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:05.48,1:53:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não sei de nada, droga!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.24,1:53:07.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:06.36,1:53:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi você, desgraçado!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.56,1:53:08.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:07.68,1:53:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pare de berrar!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.19,1:53:10.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:09.31,1:53:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dê o fora!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.37,1:53:11.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:10.49,1:53:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi você!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.87,1:53:18.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:11.99,1:53:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,'Foi você!' Vá se danar! Por acaso meu filho precisa da sua filha?! Eu tenho uma noiva maravilhosa para ele aqui, suma daqui!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.96,1:53:25.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:18.08,1:53:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya! Cunhada, pelo amor de Deus, se você souber de algo, diga! Foi você, não foi?! Cunhada, pelo amor de Deus...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.84,1:53:35.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:27.96,1:53:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não fiz isso! Que Deus e o Alcorão me castiguem se minto, eu não sei! Mas eu juro que vou encontrar ela, cunhada! Prometo! Vamos, Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.75,1:53:43.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:39.87,1:53:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo amor de Deus, Şahin, ela também é da família para nós! Nós também vamos procurar! Vão logo, saiam daqui!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.23,1:53:45.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:43.35,1:53:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Velho, saia da frente! Vai para lá!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.39,1:53:46.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:45.51,1:53:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.92,1:53:47.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:46.04,1:53:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro que foram eles!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.42,1:53:48.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:47.54,1:53:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Entra no carro logo, vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.42,1:53:49.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:48.54,1:53:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Para o carro, vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.38,1:53:50.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:49.50,1:53:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus castigue vocês!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.38,1:53:51.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:50.50,1:53:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.38,1:53:52.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:51.50,1:53:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Entrem logo! Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.38,1:53:53.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:52.50,1:53:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.44,1:53:54.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:53.56,1:53:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não fiz isso!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.53,1:53:55.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:54.65,1:53:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.59,1:53:57.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:55.71,1:53:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Acredita em mim!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.93,1:53:58.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:57.05,1:53:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu juro que não fui eu!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.93,1:53:59.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:58.05,1:53:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu juro por Deus!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.21,1:54:00.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:59.33,1:54:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.72,1:54:01.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:00.84,1:54:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, vamos entrar!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.72,1:54:03.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:01.84,1:54:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.48,1:54:08.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:06.60,1:54:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Escuta aqui!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.88,1:54:09.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:08.00,1:54:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Entra! Eu não fiz nada!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.58,1:54:11.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:09.70,1:54:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.56,1:54:12.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:11.68,1:54:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.56,1:54:14.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:12.68,1:54:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já vou, tá bom!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.22,1:54:17.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:16.34,1:54:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Rapaz, escuta bem!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.76,1:54:20.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:17.88,1:54:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nunca mais aponte uma arma para o meu irmão!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.82,1:54:21.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:19.94,1:54:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro que você vai pagar caro por isso!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.65,1:54:24.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:21.77,1:54:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Não perca a cabeça, cale-se, não se complique!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.97,1:54:27.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:24.09,1:54:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya, meu filho, venha para dentro.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.28,1:54:34.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:31.40,1:54:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,İpek, eu preciso encontrar aquela van!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.03,1:54:35.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:35.15,1:54:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,De que cor ela era?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.25,1:54:38.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:36.37,1:54:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Você viu a placa?! Me diz, fala logo!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.37,1:54:40.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:38.49,1:54:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,E o que você tem a ver com isso?! O que te importa?!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.11,1:54:44.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:41.23,1:54:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,İpek, você viu a placa? Me diz, por favor!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.09,1:54:46.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:45.21,1:54:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,İpek, não diga nada, minha filha!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.00,1:54:56.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:52.12,1:54:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, não é hora para ciúmes nem mal-entendidos, está bem?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.39,1:54:57.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:56.51,1:54:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendeu?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.28,1:54:59.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:57.40,1:54:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A vida da Zerrin está em risco aqui!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.52,1:55:01.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:59.64,1:55:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você viu a placa, diz logo!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.23,1:55:01.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:01.35,1:55:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Você viu?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.83,1:55:06.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:04.95,1:55:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Diz!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.66,1:55:10.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:08.78,1:55:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,47 B 6933.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.33,1:55:15.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:13.45,1:55:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,47 B 6933.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.62,1:55:16.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:15.74,1:55:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,54.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.54,1:55:18.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:16.66,1:55:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,6933 54, está bem!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.34,1:55:18.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:18.46,1:55:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.92,1:55:23.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:22.04,1:55:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Me deixa ir.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.87,1:55:25.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:24.99,1:55:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha filha...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.92,1:55:26.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:26.04,1:55:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,İpek!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.19,1:55:28.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:27.31,1:55:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha o que você fez!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.51,1:55:29.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:28.63,1:55:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você tem a ver com isso?!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.56,1:55:30.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:29.68,1:55:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha no estado em que você deixou a moça!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.84,1:55:32.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:30.96,1:55:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela é a sua noiva!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.38,1:55:33.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:32.50,1:55:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você tem a ver com a Zerrin?!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.42,1:55:34.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:33.54,1:55:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A garota já se casou, seguiu a vida!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.70,1:55:35.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:34.82,1:55:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está noivo!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.84,1:55:36.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:35.96,1:55:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O que isso te importa?!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.90,1:55:39.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:38.02,1:55:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.18,1:55:39.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:39.30,1:55:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fala.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.60,1:55:41.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:39.72,1:55:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu preciso achar essa van.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.65,1:55:43.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:41.77,1:55:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo amor de Deus, eu tenho que encontrá-la.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.64,1:55:46.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:45.76,1:55:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vem comigo agora.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.78,1:55:47.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:46.90,1:55:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem comigo.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.63,1:55:53.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:50.75,1:55:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você não atendeu o celular quando eu te liguei, rapaz?!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.16,1:55:54.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:53.28,1:55:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, o depósito ficava no subsolo.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.66,1:55:55.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:54.78,1:55:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Não dava sinal de rede lá.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.76,1:56:00.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:57.88,1:55:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, pelo amor de Deus, eu não fiz isso!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.83,1:56:02.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:59.95,1:56:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Você já fez uma loucura dessas antes...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.10,1:56:02.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:02.22,1:56:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.82,1:56:04.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:02.94,1:56:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora me dê um motivo para acreditar em você.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.00,1:56:06.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:05.12,1:56:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fala, rapaz!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.52,1:56:09.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:06.64,1:56:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, a garota já se casou, seguiu a vida dela, está grávida!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.24,1:56:11.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:09.36,1:56:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou me casar! Por que eu faria isso, irmão?!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.98,1:56:16.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:14.10,1:56:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,O Kadir Velho vai com vocês.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.28,1:56:19.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:18.40,1:56:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,E anotem essa placa num papel.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.76,1:56:21.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:19.88,1:56:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Vão lá e procurem! Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.01,1:56:21.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:21.13,1:56:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.06,1:56:23.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:22.18,1:56:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, não faça isso!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.61,1:56:26.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:23.73,1:56:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, o que você está fazendo?! Por que está permitindo uma coisa dessas?!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.30,1:56:27.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:26.42,1:56:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.00,1:56:28.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:27.12,1:56:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Escute.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.48,1:56:28.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:27.60,1:56:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, olha aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.36,1:56:30.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:28.48,1:56:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A garota se casou e seguiu a vida, o meu filho está noivo!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.74,1:56:33.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:30.86,1:56:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,O que nós temos a ver com isso?! O que nos importa a filha dos outros, pelo amor de Deus?!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.76,1:56:37.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:33.88,1:56:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem, já estou com a cabeça cheia. Vem logo, vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.43,1:56:40.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:37.55,1:56:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que vou perder a cabeça...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.06,1:56:48.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:41.18,1:56:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhem aqui para mim, rapazes: vocês vão para o lado dos desfiladeiros, revirem cada centímetro!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.10,1:56:53.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:49.22,1:56:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Avisem aos outros que eles cobrem a entrada de Mardin, ouviram bem?! A entrada de Mardin!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.30,1:56:56.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:53.42,1:56:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Procurem em cada sombra, rapazes! Vocês têm que encontrar a cunhada de vocês!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.81,1:56:58.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:56.93,1:56:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, rápido!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.83,1:57:04.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:58.95,1:57:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zerrin, se eu não te encontrar... eu queimo o mundo inteiro de quem tocar em você!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.81,1:57:06.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:04.93,1:57:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu boto fogo no mundo inteiro!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.27,1:57:10.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:06.39,1:57:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem pode ter feito isso? Não tem ninguém em mente, pai?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.97,1:57:20.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:18.09,1:57:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, foi aquele cachorro do Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.60,1:57:23.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:20.72,1:57:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém além daquele desgraçado teria coragem de fazer isso!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.24,1:57:28.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:26.36,1:57:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.05,1:57:32.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:31.17,1:57:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo o que fizeram contra nós se voltaria contra eles.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.73,1:57:45.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:42.85,1:57:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunhada, cunhada, não fique assim.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.10,1:57:48.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:46.22,1:57:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,O rapaz repetiu tantas vezes que não foi ele, você ouviu!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.56,1:57:56.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:54.68,1:57:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu peito está em chamas...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.98,1:58:11.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:08.10,1:58:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Deus, meu Deus, Tu és grande...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.31,1:58:21.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:18.43,1:58:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Adem, olha bem para esta Mardin.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.22,1:58:27.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:25.34,1:58:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vamos deixar um único canto sem revistar!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.67,1:58:29.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:27.79,1:58:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Se for preciso, entraremos em cada buraco desta cidade!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.06,1:58:31.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:30.18,1:58:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas nós vamos achar aquela van!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.03,1:58:33.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:32.15,1:58:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos achar, irmão.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.40,1:58:34.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:33.52,1:58:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos achar!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.40,1:58:37.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:34.52,1:58:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde você está, desgraçado?!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.75,1:58:46.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:42.87,1:58:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai arder, mas você vai sentir um pouco, claro.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.09,1:58:56.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:53.21,1:58:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu acredito que o Kaya disse a verdade.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.56,1:58:58.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:57.68,1:58:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que não foi ele.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.87,1:59:07.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:01.99,1:59:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A Dona Sadakat também diz que não fez nada, mas quando se trata dela, eu não consigo acreditar.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.93,1:59:11.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:10.05,1:59:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que ela armou alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.87,1:59:18.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:12.99,1:59:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer dizer, se ela soubesse do bebê e tentasse algo assim, até entenderia...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.05,1:59:21.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:18.17,1:59:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,mas agora não havia motivo para isso, ela não faria.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.94,1:59:25.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:21.06,1:59:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem, sou obrigado a perguntar, vou perguntar só uma vez.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.02,1:59:27.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:27.14,1:59:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Última pergunta.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.48,1:59:31.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:28.60,1:59:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoje de manhã, quando falávamos disso, você disse que ia pensar em algo.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.29,1:59:34.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:32.41,1:59:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu até disse: 'Mãe, pensar no quê?'.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.17,1:59:37.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:35.29,1:59:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, e outro dia você disse: 'Aquela criança é um Albora!'.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.99,1:59:39.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:38.11,1:59:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sobre o bebê da Zerrin.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.58,1:59:41.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:40.70,1:59:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não fez nada, fez?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.38,1:59:46.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:43.50,1:59:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Neste momento, só me arrependo de não ter feito!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.97,1:59:50.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:49.09,1:59:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Parabéns.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.92,2:00:02.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:01.04,2:00:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A sua mão está doendo?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.30,2:00:04.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:02.42,2:00:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, Alya, não é nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.14,2:00:05.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:04.26,2:00:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.21,2:00:07.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:06.33,2:00:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Por nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.26,2:00:12.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:10.38,2:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe! Pai!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.62,2:00:15.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:14.74,2:00:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha só quem chegou!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.21,2:00:17.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:16.33,2:00:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pai, o que aconteceu com você?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.18,2:00:19.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:18.30,2:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Não aconteceu nada com o seu pai.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.74,2:00:21.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:19.86,2:00:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele só tinha um machucadinho de nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.08,2:00:22.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:21.20,2:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu limpei e já passou.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.60,2:00:23.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:22.72,2:00:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Não foi nada demais.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.44,2:00:26.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:23.56,2:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, estava vindo barulho de tiros lá de fora.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.38,2:00:32.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:27.50,2:00:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A tia Pakize me disse que estavam caçando lobos. Mas não tinha sido proibido caçar?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.33,2:00:33.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:32.45,2:00:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.03,2:00:33.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:33.15,2:00:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela disse isso?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.81,2:00:38.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:34.93,2:00:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Assim que ouvi aqueles tiros, saí correndo lá para fora.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.26,2:00:45.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:39.38,2:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu disse: 'O Cihan deu ordem expressa, é estritamente proibido qualquer tipo de caça!'.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.98,2:00:47.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:45.10,2:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Aí eles disseram que não sabiam e pediram desculpas.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.28,2:00:49.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:48.40,2:00:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.44,2:00:54.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:49.56,2:00:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,De onde vem tanta conversa boa? Fizeram as pazes, posso beijar vocês agora?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.05,2:00:59.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:54.17,2:00:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoje à noite tem uma surpresa esperando no terraço! Mas venham bem arrumados, tá bom?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.19,2:01:01.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:59.31,2:01:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é isso agora?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.75,2:01:10.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:04.87,2:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele se juntou com o pessoal da cozinha para fazer a gente fazer as pazes, montou uma mesa de jantar no terraço.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.73,2:01:12.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:10.85,2:01:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,É por isso que ele está correndo de um lado para o outro desde cedo.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.01,2:01:18.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:16.13,2:01:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,E o que vamos fazer?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.99,2:01:26.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:24.11,2:01:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos deixá-lo feliz.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.32,2:01:29.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:28.44,2:01:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos fingir que não sabemos de nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.20,2:01:32.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:31.32,2:01:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos entrar na brincadeira dele.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.97,2:03:03.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:01.09,2:03:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu filho...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.39,2:03:40.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:39.51,2:03:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi você quem sequestrou a Zerrin?!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.23,2:03:42.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:40.35,2:03:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu filho, eu não sei de nada! Do que você está falando?!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.31,2:03:48.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:42.43,2:03:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha bem, se estiver mentindo, se a Zerrin estiver com você e acontecer algo com ela...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.32,2:03:53.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:50.44,2:03:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...olha, até a minha paciência vai acabar com você!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.04,2:03:55.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:54.16,2:03:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu mesmo te enterro naquele chão com as minhas próprias mãos!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.80,2:04:00.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:55.92,2:04:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é isso, rapaz?! Estou dizendo que não sei de absolutamente nada!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.16,2:04:23.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:19.28,2:04:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Enquanto isso, vá lá chamar eles, vamos ver...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.88,2:04:35.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:34.00,2:04:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anda, segure firme a bandeja.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.50,2:04:37.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:35.62,2:04:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já trago a sopa também.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.70,2:04:39.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:37.82,2:04:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Está quentinha, cuidado para não entornar.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.82,2:04:40.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:38.94,2:04:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Segure com isso aqui, pelo amor de Deus!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.08,2:04:42.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:41.20,2:04:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Caramba, tá muito quente!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.28,2:04:45.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:44.40,2:04:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.02,2:04:46.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:46.14,2:04:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu amor.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.22,2:04:47.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:47.34,2:04:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.94,2:04:50.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:48.06,2:04:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não ia se arrumar?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.21,2:04:52.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:50.33,2:04:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas o que é que tem?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.80,2:04:53.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:52.92,2:04:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde está o meu pai?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.21,2:04:56.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:54.33,2:04:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu pai está no quarto, olha, ele já veio!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.75,2:04:59.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:56.87,2:04:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas pai, você também não se arrumou!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.69,2:05:06.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:59.81,2:05:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,É porque estamos em casa, não vamos sair, estamos confortáveis assim. E além disso, já estamos bem vestidos.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.06,2:05:08.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:07.18,2:05:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Por isso não trocamos de roupa.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.37,2:05:12.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:08.49,2:05:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Além do mais, o importante não é ficarmos todos juntos?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.65,2:05:14.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:12.77,2:05:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos subir agora?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.31,2:05:14.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:14.43,2:05:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.93,2:05:16.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:15.05,2:05:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem, então vou lavar as mãos e venho correndo!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.75,2:05:19.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:16.87,2:05:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, anda, seja rápida! Vamos, vamos!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.75,2:05:26.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:24.87,2:05:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ümmü?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.00,2:05:35.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:34.12,2:05:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.50,2:05:38.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:36.62,2:05:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,O que tem aí dentro?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.95,2:05:39.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:39.07,2:05:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,É...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.23,2:05:42.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:40.35,2:05:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Aonde você está levando isso?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.69,2:05:46.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:42.81,2:05:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,É... eu não estou levando para lugar nenhum.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.89,2:05:51.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:48.01,2:05:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Que armação vocês estão fazendo pelas minhas costas, hein?!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.48,2:05:53.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:51.60,2:05:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, nós não estamos fazendo nada!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.10,2:05:55.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:54.22,2:05:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não fizemos nada!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.42,2:05:59.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:57.54,2:05:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.59,2:06:00.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:59.71,2:06:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é o que parece!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.80,2:06:04.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:03.92,2:06:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.11,2:06:06.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:05.23,2:06:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.67,2:06:07.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:06.79,2:06:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.96,2:06:12.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:10.08,2:06:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Que palhaçada é essa?!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.61,2:06:15.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:13.73,2:06:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Que pouca vergonha é essa, Ümmü?!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.01,2:06:21.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:17.13,2:06:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês prepararam isso para o Cihan e a Dona Alya!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.41,2:06:29.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:21.53,2:06:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Enquanto o meu filho está lá embaixo sentindo o cheiro da terra da cova, eles vão se refestelar neste banquete, é?!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.42,2:06:38.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:36.54,2:06:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tiveram vergonha na cara!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.21,2:06:41.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:39.33,2:06:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês não têm um pingo de vergonha!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.93,2:06:45.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:43.05,2:06:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Não têm vergonha nenhuma!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.12,2:06:47.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:46.24,2:06:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nenhuma!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.18,2:06:49.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:47.30,2:06:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Que pouca vergonha é essa?!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.19,2:06:50.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:49.31,2:06:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.39,2:06:52.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:50.51,2:06:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Que vergonha de vocês!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.37,2:06:55.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:53.49,2:06:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Até isso vocês tiveram coragem de fazer comigo!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.60,2:06:59.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:57.72,2:06:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenham vergonha!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.60,2:07:02.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:00.72,2:07:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos para o quarto!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.98,2:07:06.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:05.10,2:07:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu conheço vocês!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.52,2:07:08.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:06.64,2:07:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Não resista!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.94,2:07:08.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:08.06,2:07:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos logo, anda!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.94,2:07:26.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:23.06,2:07:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Velho, Kadir, deem licença para nós.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.60,2:07:51.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:48.72,2:07:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado, com licença, nos perdoem.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.17,2:07:55.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:53.29,2:07:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois conversamos, Velho. Vamos, Kadir.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.11,2:08:04.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:59.23,2:08:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês aproveitaram a minha saída para montar uma mesa de banquete aqui!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.46,2:08:11.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:05.58,2:08:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês iam ficar aqui se esbaldando enquanto o Boran jaz debaixo da terra!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.92,2:08:14.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:13.04,2:08:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não teve vergonha na cara!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.52,2:08:17.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:14.64,2:08:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, a criança só queria ser feliz!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.59,2:08:19.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:17.71,2:08:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós apenas entramos na brincadeira dele, só isso!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.51,2:08:20.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:19.63,2:08:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa ideia não saiu da sua cabeça!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.97,2:08:23.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:21.09,2:08:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Com certeza saiu da cabeça da Alya!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.24,2:08:24.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:23.36,2:08:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi ideia dela, não foi?!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.81,2:08:26.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:24.93,2:08:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,E você foi na onda dela!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.22,2:08:28.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:26.34,2:08:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Você cedeu aos caprichos dela! Como pôde ceder?!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.60,2:08:29.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:28.72,2:08:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Como ela consegue te manipular?!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.12,2:08:32.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:30.24,2:08:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa mulher manipula todos vocês como quer!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.92,2:08:34.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:33.04,2:08:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela faz de vocês gato e sapato!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.05,2:08:36.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:35.17,2:08:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A Alya não sabia de nada!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.43,2:08:37.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:36.55,2:08:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, nem eu sabia!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.27,2:08:40.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:37.39,2:08:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A criança só queria que ficássemos todos juntos, que fossemos felizes!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.17,2:08:42.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:41.29,2:08:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi por isso que ele fez!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:42.66,2:08:46.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:42.78,2:08:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A felicidade daquela criança e a nossa felicidade...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.20,2:08:49.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:46.32,2:08:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...dependem exclusivamente de ele reencontrar o pai!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.40,2:08:52.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:49.52,2:08:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai acordar o pai, vai até ele, vai falar com ele, e o pai vai acordar!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.98,2:08:54.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:53.10,2:08:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Aí sim todos nós seremos felizes!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.51,2:09:01.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:57.63,2:09:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha aqui, Cihan: você não fez, mas eu vou fazer!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.12,2:09:04.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:02.24,2:09:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou fazer! Falta muito pouco, Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.38,2:09:06.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:04.50,2:09:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Falta só esse tantinho aqui, e eu vou fazer, esteja avisado!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.97,2:09:13.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:10.09,2:09:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não somos suas inimigas, Dona Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.35,2:09:22.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:19.47,2:09:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não somos seus inimigos!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.94,2:09:46.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:44.06,2:09:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tem razão... tem razão.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.99,2:10:12.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:10.11,2:10:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, por que não fomos?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.57,2:10:15.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:13.69,2:10:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu amor, tudo bem... Não fique triste.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.82,2:10:16.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:15.94,2:10:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha só.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.03,2:10:19.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:17.15,2:10:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Não subimos... O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.03,2:10:23.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:20.15,2:10:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu um acidente, a mesa virou.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.02,2:10:26.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:25.14,2:10:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Como virou?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.68,2:10:29.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:27.80,2:10:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Por causa do vento.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.15,2:10:36.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:35.27,2:10:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Não podia virar, ela é muito pesada!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.67,2:10:41.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:36.79,2:10:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,É verdade, mas o vento soprou com muita força e tombou a mesa.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.38,2:10:42.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:41.50,2:10:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente faz uma bem melhor!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.88,2:10:43.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:43.00,2:10:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.99,2:10:45.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:44.11,2:10:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas nós vamos fazer juntos!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.62,2:10:48.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:45.74,2:10:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Não! Eu quero que vocês façam as pazes!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.53,2:10:49.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:48.65,2:10:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquem como eram antes!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.99,2:10:57.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:52.11,2:10:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha cá perto de mim. O que quer dizer com 'fiquem como eram antes'?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.14,2:10:59.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:57.26,2:10:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós já somos como éramos antes! Nós já...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.78,2:11:03.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:59.90,2:11:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem disse que estamos brigados? Por que você se desgasta com essas coisas?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:03.53,2:11:05.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:03.65,2:11:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês estão brigados sim!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.09,2:11:07.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:05.21,2:11:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Não estamos, não estamos brigados de jeito nenhum!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.57,2:11:11.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:07.69,2:11:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Não estão? Então se abracem! Vamos, se abracem!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.24,2:11:15.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:12.36,2:11:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz, meu filho, o que tem a ver uma coisa com a outra, meu amor?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:15.04,2:11:19.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:15.16,2:11:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Porque vocês estão brigados sim! Estão brigados!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:20.02,2:11:21.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:20.14,2:11:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Não estamos, não estamos brigados!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.02,2:11:22.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:21.14,2:11:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Estão sim!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:22.02,2:11:24.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:22.14,2:11:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu filho, não estamos brigados!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:24.11,2:11:26.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:24.23,2:11:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Então se abracem logo! Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:26.87,2:11:28.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:26.99,2:11:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Não faça isso, filho.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.87,2:11:29.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:27.99,2:11:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.02,2:11:31.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:29.14,2:11:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Então se abracem! Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.38,2:11:33.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:31.50,2:11:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vinda.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:25.66,2:12:26.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:25.78,2:12:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe-me ver.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.66,2:12:28.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:26.78,2:12:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fez o que eu mandei?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.37,2:13:21.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:19.49,2:13:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, Dona Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.29,2:13:23.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:21.41,2:13:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tome aqui.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.73,2:13:29.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:26.85,2:13:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Você procurou por isso, Dona Alya.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:33.02,2:13:35.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:33.14,2:13:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi você quem pediu por isso!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.10,2:13:38.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:36.22,2:13:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Meninas...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.45,2:13:58.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:56.57,2:13:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos entrar.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.77,2:14:06.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:03.89,2:14:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe com nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.36,2:14:30.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:24.48,2:14:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu útero não sofrerá nenhum dano, inclusive, depois da cirurgia, se quiser, poderá até engravidar de novo.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:30.15,2:14:32.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:30.27,2:14:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Abra a porta.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.25,2:14:35.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:33.37,2:14:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Me passe o pão aí.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.79,2:15:33.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:29.91,2:15:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Me dê um pouco de torta também, está quentinha e saborosa.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.67,2:15:35.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:33.79,2:15:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não quero.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:36.92,2:15:40.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:37.04,2:15:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eles ainda não encontraram aquela van, continuam procurando.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:40.68,2:15:42.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:40.80,2:15:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Falei com o Şahin.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.92,2:15:46.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:43.04,2:15:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou sair com o Kadir agora, vamos procurar por todo canto.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:46.34,2:15:48.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:46.46,2:15:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois é.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:48.79,2:15:53.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:48.91,2:15:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Em vez de se preocuparem com a Zerrin e correrem atrás dela, deviam se preocupar com o Boran, que está debaixo da terra!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.70,2:15:55.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:53.82,2:15:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós estamos cuidando dele, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:55.14,2:15:58.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:55.26,2:15:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde está o Deniz? O menino não veio tomar café?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:57.93,2:15:58.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:58.05,2:15:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Está dormindo.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:59.88,2:16:02.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:00.00,2:16:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A Alya também não está, irmão.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.70,2:16:06.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:04.82,2:16:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela tinha uma cirurgia.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.53,2:16:07.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:06.65,2:16:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Saiu bem cedo hoje.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.87,2:16:17.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:14.99,2:16:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi? Aconteceu alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:25.68,2:16:27.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:25.80,2:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Não são boas notícias.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:28.85,2:16:31.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:28.97,2:16:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu uma coisa ruim, patrão.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:33.02,2:16:33.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:33.14,2:16:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:33.78,2:16:36.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:33.90,2:16:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma coisa muito ruim, patrão. Algo muito grave aconteceu!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.25,2:16:37.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:36.37,2:16:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma, o que aconteceu?!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.91,2:16:39.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:38.03,2:16:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus nos proteja...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.37,2:16:43.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:41.49,2:16:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A polícia está no portão!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.65,2:16:47.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:46.77,2:16:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A polícia?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.56,2:16:48.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:47.68,2:16:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A polícia?!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:48.51,2:16:49.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:48.63,2:16:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, viaturas da polícia!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.10,2:16:55.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:53.22,2:16:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Que seja por um bom motivo...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:57.35,2:16:59.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:57.47,2:16:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus tenha piedade.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.23,2:17:02.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:01.35,2:17:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.05,2:17:03.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:02.17,2:17:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Olá, sejam bem-vindos.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.15,2:17:04.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:03.27,2:17:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado, bom dia.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.48,2:17:06.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:04.60,2:17:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vindos. Em que podemos ajudar?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:06.07,2:17:06.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:06.19,2:17:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:06.77,2:17:09.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:06.89,2:17:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Viemos a respeito de um ocorrido no Hospital Yonca.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:09.00,2:17:13.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:09.12,2:17:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Estamos aqui devido a uma queixa prestada por colocar em risco a vida da paciente Güler Haşmetlioğlu.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:13.62,2:17:14.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:13.74,2:17:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma queixa?!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.32,2:17:16.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:14.44,2:17:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem eles denunciaram?!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:16.07,2:17:18.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:16.19,2:17:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadakat Albora.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.20,2:17:25.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:20.32,2:17:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não tem nada disso! Há algum engano aí, isso é impossível!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:45.41,2:17:48.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:45.53,2:17:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Com certeza não existe nada disso!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:47.83,2:17:53.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:47.95,2:17:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, a senhora terá que nos acompanhar até a delegacia sob a acusação de pôr em risco a vida de Güler Haşmetlioğlu.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:53.23,2:17:55.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:53.35,2:17:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não fiz nada disso!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:04.20,2:18:06.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:04.32,2:18:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não coloquei a vida de ninguém em risco, isso é mentira!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.62,2:18:11.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:06.74,2:18:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,E além do mais, quem poderia ter me denunciado?! Quem teria a audácia de fazer uma coisa dessas?!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:11.66,2:18:14.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:11.78,2:18:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fui eu quem fez a denúncia.
